flowchart LR
  subgraph Client[Existing Product]
    Flutter[Flutter customer feature]
    Laravel[LARAVEL platform / auth]
  end

  subgraph Node[Mirror Node.js AI Service]
    API[Versioned REST API]
    Guard[Validation + tenancy + portrait guard]
    Analysis[Consultation orchestrator]
    TryOn[Try-on job orchestrator]
    ModelRoute[Primary / fallback router]
  end

  subgraph AI[Server-only AI providers]
    Gemini[Gemini visual analysis]
    OpenAI[OpenAI analysis fallback]
    ImagePrimary[Primary image edit]
    ImageFallback[Fallback image edit]
  end

  subgraph Data[Data and storage]
    ObjectStore[Portrait and preview object storage]
    AiDb[AI feature schema]
    LaravelDb[Existing Laravel database]
  end

  Flutter -->|JWT + portrait + requirement| API
  Laravel -->|tenant/customer context| API
  API --> Guard
  Guard --> Analysis
  Guard --> TryOn
  Analysis --> ModelRoute
  TryOn --> ModelRoute
  ModelRoute --> Gemini
  ModelRoute --> OpenAI
  ModelRoute --> ImagePrimary
  ModelRoute --> ImageFallback
  Analysis --> ObjectStore
  TryOn --> ObjectStore
  API --> AiDb
  AiDb -.maps stable IDs.-> LaravelDb
  API -->|response / job status| Flutter
